sequenceDiagram
    participant User as External User
    participant IstioGW as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant BFF as BFF (model-registry-ui)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP mTLS
    participant MR as Model Registry API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as InferenceService Controller
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User, K8sAPI: Flow 1: UI User Request
        User->>IstioGW: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS, Istio principal auth
        IstioGW->>BFF: HTTP/8080<br/>Istio mTLS<br/>Bearer Token or SA token
        BFF->>MR: HTTP/8080<br/>Configurable TLS<br/>Internal auth
        MR-->>BFF: Model metadata response
        BFF->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/6443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
        Note right of BFF: SubjectAccessReview<br/>SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>ConfigMap/Secret CRUD
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorization result
        BFF-->>IstioGW: JSON response
        IstioGW-->>User: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Controller, MR: Flow 2: InferenceService Reconciliation
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService CRs<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: InferenceService events
        Controller->>K8sAPI: List Services (label: component=model-registry)<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Service endpoints
        Controller->>MR: Update inference service URLs<br/>HTTP/dynamic port<br/>Configurable TLS, Internal auth
        MR-->>Controller: Update confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over BFF, S3: Flow 3: Async Artifact Upload
        Note right of BFF: Triggered by BFF creating<br/>batch/v1 Job
        BFF->>K8sAPI: Create Job (async-upload)<br/>HTTPS/6443
        K8sAPI-->>BFF: Job created
        Note over S3: async-upload Job runs
        K8sAPI->>S3: Upload model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443<br/>AWS IAM credentials
        S3-->>K8sAPI: Upload complete
    end
